873
00:56:58,446 --> 00:56:58,682
Right.

874
00:56:59,054 --> 00:57:08,356
Like robotics, any physical system is fundamentally about based on the information you have at the present moment and before, what should you do next?

875
00:57:08,750 --> 00:57:11,268
So it's really about predicting what comes next.

876
00:57:11,824 --> 00:57:15,716
So predicting robot actions is like predicting what the robot should do next.

877
00:57:16,014 --> 00:57:19,108
But if you think about it, robot is just a part of the world, right?

878
00:57:19,744 --> 00:57:25,540
Robot influences the world, but the world also influences how the robot should behave in that environment.

879
00:57:26,126 --> 00:57:35,104
So if you think about it this way, then the maximal, the most first principle thing you can do is just predict as much of the world that you can possibly predict, right?

880
00:57:36,046 --> 00:57:39,104
So that's why we believe predicting the future is extremely important.

881
00:57:39,264 --> 00:57:42,436
And today, the instantiation is world action model.

882
00:57:42,798 --> 00:57:48,516
And VLA only predicts robot actions or some more abstract representation of the world.

883
00:57:48,784 --> 00:57:57,444
